div.p:
Mr. McFarlane stated that this concluded the NSC meeting and indicated that more
                            sessions will be held the following week as we finalize our preparations
                            for Foreign Minister Shevardnadze’s visit. (C)

quote.p:
—Give Shevardnadze as much
                                information as possible and appropriate to set the stage for a productive November meeting and progress at the
                                    Geneva talks;

head.hi:
