                                Sensitive.

quote.p:
—MBFR Ambassador Mikhailov would
                                meet with an American representative in Moscow during the last 10
                                days of August;

div.p:
—that we continue to reject any overt linkage between the cases of
                                Daniloff and Soviet U.N.
                            Secretariat staffer Zakharov;

quote.p:
—That, although their investigation has not yet reached any
                                conclusions, the Soviets have evidence that Daniloff has been engaged in
                                activities which are against Soviet law;

div.p:
—We do not consider Dubinin’s
                            approach of September 10 to be a reply to Asst. Sec. Ridgway’s proposal to Sokolov of
                            September 9;

quote.p:
—engage in serious and visible preparations
                                that show we have a unified U.S. team as well as close allied
                                consultation and support;

—Get the focus for priority attention back on START, where we seek a ceiling on
                                ballistic missile warheads and subceilings which can form the heart
                                of a strategic arms reduction agreement;
